Revision history for Parallel-Goroutine

0.01  2026-10-13
    - First release.
    - go BLOCK LIST starts a forked goroutine; returns its PID.
    - chan() creates a channel with send / recv / close / each.
    - gselect TIMEOUT, CHANNELS waits on several channels at once.
    - wait_all() reaps all goroutines and reports failures.
